  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{n}}$ is perpendicular $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{u}}$ and $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}, \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{n}}=\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{u}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}$\n$\\hat{\\mathrm{n}}=\\frac{\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\\mathrm{i} & \\mathrm{j} & \\mathrm{k} \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0\\end{array}\\right|}{\\sqrt{2} \\times \\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{-2 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}}}{2}=-\\hat{\\mathrm{k}}$\n$|\\vec{\\omega} \\cdot \\hat{n}|=|(\\mathrm{i}+2 \\mathrm{j}+3 \\mathrm{k}) \\cdot(-\\mathrm{k})|=|-3|=3$",
    "image": null
